  "summary": "This 2-day itinerary for Seoul focuses on history and culture in the Jongno, Insadong, Gwanghwamun, and Namsan areas. You'll explore magnificent palaces, traditional hanok villages, charming cultural streets, and enjoy panoramic views, all while immersing yourself in Korea's rich heritage.",
